{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Bring out</b> — the meaning is from ממסגר, because he was in a cave. And I already mentioned that the force of nouns is in verbs. If so, <b>the righteous will crown him</b> — a crown. The meaning: that they will boast, as though a royal crown were on their head."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 142, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:42:32.186932258Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}